{
  "id": "gamestop",
  "name": "GameStop",
  "category": "retailer_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "The cards GameStop gave away with Pokémon TCG purchases, most of them for an expansion's release. In 2018 three carried a logo other shops' copies shared: Heatran with the Ultra Prism logo, from 2 to 28 February 2018, then Zygarde for Forbidden Light and Groudon for Celestial Storm with the Year of Legendary Pokémon logo. Most of the others carry GameStop's own logo on the picture, among them Duraludon for the launch of Evolving Skies on 27 August 2021, Hisuian Zoroark from 9 September 2022 and Teal Mask Ogerpon from 24 May 2024, and from Phantasmal Flames several are pixel cosmos holofoil.\n\nEB Games gave many of the same cards with its own logo. For the 30th anniversary of Pokémon GameStop gave Zarude with the \"What's Your Favorite?\" logo.",
